Template-Type: ReDIF-Paper 1.0
Title: IDER-2021: INTERNATIONAL REPORTS OF INDIA, CHINA, OECD, AFRICA, EUROPE AND WORLD DEVELOPMENT FOR 1995-2019
Author-name: GUISAN, Maria-Carmen
Author-Email: mcarmen.guisan@usc.es
Length: 
Abstract: We present the final versions of the International Development Economic Reports (IDER) of year 2021, published by the Euro-American Association of Economic Development Studies. IDER-2021 includes:  1) analysis of the impact of Education on Development, Quality of Government and Life satisfaction in 164 countries for 1995-2019, 2) a comparative analysis of Employment and Development in India, China and OECD countries for the period 1950-2020,3) industry and development in 53 African countries in year 2017 and 4) A comparative analysis of production per capita, mean productivity per worker and average real wages of Spain, France, Germany and the United States for 1960-2019.
