Length: 47 pages
Abstract: This document is an e-book in Spanish of the Association of Euro-American Economic Development Studies. It is a version, summarized by the authors, of the printed book of Guisán, Aguayo and Expósito (2013): Sectoral Employment and social participation: situation in Europe from a gender perspective. A new document 120, will present main results in English.
